# Server-only secrets — DO NOT put real values in this file.
# This file is committed to git, so anything here is public.
# Put the real values in .env.local (gitignored via *.local) for local
# dev, and in the hosting provider's environment settings for deploys.
#
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  - required by /api/collect to write
#                                analytics_events (that table is
#                                deny-all to anon/authenticated).
#                                Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings
#                                -> API -> service_role.
#   ANALYTICS_SALT             - any long random string; used to hash
#                                visitor IPs so they are not stored raw.
#
# Note: analytics-collect.ts returns 204 and logs nothing when these are
# absent, so analytics fails SILENTLY. If the Analytics page is empty,
# check these two first.
